{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/JSON Serialization.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/JSON Serialization.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"json serialization json serialization","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/JSON Serialization.md","fileName":"JSON Serialization.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"JSON Serialization","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-06 20:31\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[HTTP API Integration]] [[.NET Files Streams and Serialization]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["HTTP API Integration",".NET Files Streams and Serialization","HTTP Response","Angular HttpClient","gameprogrammingincplusplus.pdf","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","aspnetcore3andangular9_3ed.pdf","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/JSON Serialization.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/JSON Serialization.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"json serialization json serialization","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/JSON Serialization.md","fileName":"JSON Serialization.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"JSON Serialization","heading":"JSON Serialization","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"JSON serialization converts application data into a language-independent text representation that can be placed in an [[HTTP Response]]. Deserialization performs the reverse transformation so a typed client or server object can represent the received values.\n\nAn ASP.NET Core endpoint can serialize health or entity results, and an Angular client can consume the same structure through [[Angular HttpClient]]. Naming conventions must agree across the boundary or be configured explicitly.\n\nThe Azure projects serialize work items, queue messages, cognitive-service responses, and bot configuration at system boundaries. The bot chapter also uses the .NET Core 3 `JsonDocument` API to select an intent's response array from an embedded JSON resource without constructing a larger object model.","tags":["baby"],"links":["HTTP API Integration",".NET Files Streams and Serialization","HTTP Response","Angular HttpClient","gameprogrammingincplusplus.pdf","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","aspnetcore3andangular9_3ed.pdf","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/JSON Serialization.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/JSON Serialization.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"json serialization json serialization","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/JSON Serialization.md","fileName":"JSON Serialization.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"JSON Serialization","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[gameprogrammingincplusplus.pdf]]\n[[c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf]]\n\n[[aspnetcore3andangular9_3ed.pdf]]\n[[c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["HTTP API Integration",".NET Files Streams and Serialization","HTTP Response","Angular HttpClient","gameprogrammingincplusplus.pdf","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","aspnetcore3andangular9_3ed.pdf","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}